Package: incremental
Type: Package
Title: Vector Incremental Treatment Effects
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Denis", "Agniel", email = "denis.agniel@rand.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Max", "Rubinstein", email = "mrubinstein@rand.org", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: Implements vector incremental treatment effects for causal inference with multiple binary treatments. Provides doubly-robust estimation with efficient influence functions, support for multiple divergence measures (KL, reverse KL, f-divergences), and comprehensive simulation tools.
